+"""Bounded native selected-slide ODP/OTP/FODP merge, without rendering or I/O.
+
+The existing native normalizer carries PNG/JPEG and embedded chart resources
+into flat ODF. Only selected page subtrees are retained. Document-wide font,
+style, master and settings structures must agree exactly. This deliberately
+refuses ambiguous links, identifiers, custom shows, animations and forms.
